From adf4200c06c4e75a98eb7ea35d1101d362ba0b13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <devin@cognition.ai>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:05:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] L1: dedicated gst-plugins coverage (~70 tests)

New GstPluginL1Tests suite driving gstsubtecmp4transform and
gstvipertransform through the GstBaseTransform vfuncs: caps transform
mapping, viper_ttml_format preservation, mdat payload extraction,
passthrough for non-TTML, TTML time offsetting and multi-document
buffer splitting, flush reset.

NOTE: pins actual findBoxOffsetAndLength behaviour - boxLength includes
the 8-byte box header while boxOffset points at payload, so the copy
over-reads 8 bytes past the mdat payload. Tests use a trailing free
box to keep the over-read deterministic; the source defect is real.
